> f(v: i8, m: i8) = min(max(v + m, 0), 255)
  note: literal 255 does not fit i8; it becomes -1
> g(v: i8, m: i8) = v + m
> f2(v: i8, m: i8) = (min(max(v + m, 0), 255)) + 0
  note: literal 255 does not fit i8; it becomes -1
> g2(v: i8, m: i8) = (v + m) + 0
> f1(v: i8, m: i8) = (min(max(v + m, 0), 255)) + 0
  note: literal 255 does not fit i8; it becomes -1
> equiv f g
f and g differ at 65280 points, e.g. v=-128, m=-128: -1 vs 0
> equiv f2 g2
f2 and g2 differ at 65280 points, e.g. v=-128, m=-128: -1 vs 0
> equiv f1 g
f1 and g differ at 65280 points, e.g. v=-128, m=-128: -1 vs 0
> equiv f f2
f and f2 are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
